WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.720
not that I am come to destroy the law or the prophets I am not come to destroy but to fulfill

2
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:16.480
for verily I say unto you till heaven and earth pass one jot or one tittle shall in no wise pass

3
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:24.320
from the law till all be fulfilled whosoever therefore shall break one of these least commandments

4
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.360
and shall teach men so he shall be called the least in the kingdom of heaven but whosoever shall

5
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:38.240
do and teach them the same shall be called great in the kingdom of heaven for I say unto you

6
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:46.560
that except your righteousness shall exceed the righteousness of the scribes and Pharisees

7
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:53.920
ye shall in no case enter into the kingdom of heaven god is good

8
00:00:55.280 --> 00:01:01.440
and all the time good afternoon everyone good afternoon
